## SQ-HH-461 | r1112: thrown diamonds fill 4 nest slots, the 5th stays on the ground (Slot is an int)
> forceload add 20947 3987 20973 4013
sleep 3
> kill @e[type=!player,x=20947,y=-62,z=3987,dx=26,dy=17,dz=26]
> fill 20947 -61 3987 20973 -47 4013 minecraft:glass hollow
